{{also|Erdäpfel}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|ertapfel}}, {{m|gmh|erdapfel}}, {{m|gmh|ertöpfel}}, {{m|gmh|erdöpfel}}, {{m|gmh|ertaphel|t=mandrake, cucumber, pumpkin, melon}}, from {{inh|de|goh|erdapful}}, {{m|goh|erdaphul|t=pumpkin, squash, melon}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*erþapplu}}, equivalent to {{com|de|Erde|t1=earth|Apfel|t2=apple}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|aardappel|t=potato}} and {{cog|fy|ierappel|t=potato}}. Modern sense probably a {{calque|de|fr|pomme de terre|t=potato|nocap=1}}.

